## -- Tip titles and descriptions -----------------------------------------------

tips-tip1-title = Welcome to Warp!
tips-tip1-description = Warp is the intelligent terminal with AI and your team's knowledge built-in.
tips-tip2-title = Completions
tips-tip2-description = Warp provides intelligent completions as you type. Press Tab to accept.
tips-tip3-title = AI Assistance
tips-tip3-description = Use AI to explain errors, suggest commands, and more. Press Cmd+I to open the AI panel.
tips-tip4-title = Blocks
tips-tip4-description = Warp groups your commands and outputs into blocks, making it easy to copy, share, and navigate.
tips-tip5-title = Workflows
tips-tip5-description = Save parameterized commands as workflows. Press Cmd+Shift+P to open the workflow picker.

